:2,"를자":1,"주유":1,"유쾌":1,"쾌":1,"쾌케":1,"케":1,"케하":1,"고나":1,"사슬":1,"슬":1,"슬에":1,"에매":1,"매":1,"인것":1,"을부":1,"워아":1,"여로":1,"로마":1,"마에":1,"을때":1,"에나":1,"부지":1,"지런":1,"런":1,"런히":1,"히찾":1,"찾":1,"아만":1,"만":2,"만났":1,"났느":1,"여금":1,"금":1,"금그":1,"에주":1,"의긍":1,"을얻":1,"얻":1,"여주":1,"주옵":1,"서또":1,"또저":1,"가에":1,"에베":1,"베소":1,"소에":1,"서얼":1,"얼":1,"얼만":1,"만큼":1,"큼":1,"큼나":1,"를섬":1,"긴":1,"긴것":1,"가잘":1,"잘":1,"잘아":1,"아느":1},"verseMap":[{"verse":1,"text":"Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ through the will of God, according to the promise of the life which is in Christ Jesus,"},{"verse":2,"text":"to Timothy, my beloved child: Grace, mercy, and peace, from God the Father and Christ Jesus our Lord."},{"verse":3,"text":"I thank God, whom I serve as my forefathers did, with a pure conscience. How unceasing is my memory of you in my petitions, night and day"},{"verse":4,"text":"longing to see you, remembering your tears, that I may be filled with joy;"},{"verse":5,"text":"having been reminded of the sincere faith that is in you, which lived first in your grandmother Lois and your mother Eunice and, I am persuaded, in you also."},{"verse":6,"text":"For this cause, I remind you that you should stir up the gift of God which is in you through the laying on of my hands."},{"verse":7,"text":"For God didn’t give us a spirit of fear, but of power, love, and self-control."},{"verse":8,"text":"Therefore don’t be ashamed of the testimony of our Lord, nor of me his prisoner; but endure hardship for the Good News according to the power of God,"},{"verse":9,"text":"who saved us and called us with a holy calling, not according to our works, but according to his own purpose and grace, which was given to us in Christ Jesus before times eternal,"},{"verse":10,"text":"but has now been revealed by the appearing of our Savior, Christ Jesus, who abolished death, and brought life and immortality to light through the Good News."},{"verse":11,"text":"For this I was appointed as a preacher, an apostle, and a teacher of the Gentiles."},{"verse":12,"text":"For this cause I also suffer these things. Yet I am not ashamed, for I know him whom I have believed, and I am persuaded that he is able to guard that which I have committed to him against that day."},{"verse":13,"text":"Hold the pattern of sound words which you have heard from me, in faith and love which is in Christ Jesus."},{"verse":14,"text":"That good thing which was committed to you, guard through the Holy Spirit who dwells in us."},{"verse":15,"text":"This you know, that all who are in Asia turned away from me, of whom are Phygelus and Hermogenes."},{"verse":16,"text":"May the Lord grant mercy to the house of Onesiphorus, for he often refreshed me, and was not ashamed of my chain,"},{"verse":17,"text":"but when he was in Rome, he sought me diligently and found me"},{"verse":18,"text":"(the Lord grant to him to find the Lord’s mercy in that day); and in how many things he served at Ephesus, you know very well."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]